This repository contains code under different terms. Each part keeps the terms of its authors.

0. ROMs (src/roms/)
   ----------------
   128.rom, 48.rom: the ZX Spectrum 128 / 48 ROMs, copyright (c) Amstrad plc, not covered by the MIT license below
   and no license to them is granted here. Amstrad allows them to be distributed with emulators, without charge for
   them. They are included, as with emulators and other FPGA cores, so that the core works out of the box.

1. tv80 (src/rtl/tv80/)
   --------------------
   tv80: copyright (c) 2004 Guy Hutchison, under the MIT-style license in the header of each file (the copy of
   karabas_go_v6z80p with its fixes, through karabas-go-core-quadspeccy). tv80_oct.v and the generated
   tv80o_core.v / tv80o_reg.v are derived from it and keep that license. The headers must be kept.

2. karabas-go-modules (modules/, a git submodule)
   ----------------------------------------------
   Andy Karpov and contributors: the terms of that repository.

